### 3  Ask to join the tennis club (expect pending)
GET {{API}}/clubs/padel/status

### 5  Status (expect has_pending_request true)
POST {{API}}/clubs/padel/join

### 6 cancel join 
DELETE {{API}}/clubs/padel/join


#### 7  Ask to join the tennis club (expect pending)
GET {{API}}/clubs/tennis/status

### 5  Status (expect has_pending_request true)
POST {{API}}/clubs/tennis/join

### 6 cancel join 
DELETE {{API}}/clubs/tennis/join






